    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this superb three-bedroom semi-detached home to the market, ideally positioned in the mature and highly sought-after development of Lohunda Dale, Clonsilla. Perfectly located just on the outskirts of Clonsilla, this property enjoys an excellent selection of amenities right on its doorstep. Local schools, shops, cafés, bars and recreational facilities are all within easy reach, while transport links are exceptional. Both Clonsilla and Coolmine train stations are conveniently accessible, public transport routes are available at the entrance to the development, and the N3 and M50 road networks provide easy access to Dublin and beyond. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is approximately 2km away, while the Phoenix Park can be reached in around 15 minutes by car.\nInternally, the property offers approximately 107 sq. m. of bright and spacious accommodation. The ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, downstairs WC, a generous front-facing lounge complete with a feature bar, perfect for entertaining and a spacious kitchen/dining room to the rear. The property also benefits from a fantastic extended room featuring Velux windows, creating a bright and versatile additional living space. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and the main family bathroom. Externally, the front of the property benefits from a private driveway providing off-street parking, complemented by a low-maintenance landscaped garden. To the rear is a sunny west-facing garden, complete with a steel shed benefiting from electricity, as well as a separate concrete shed providing excellent additional storage. Both the front and rear gardens are equipped with double electrical sockets.\nNo. 13 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and represents a fantastic opportunity for its new owners. The property is ideally suited to first-time buyers looking to take their first step onto the property ladder, as well as those looking to trade up. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information and to arrange your viewing.\nAdditional Features:\n \n<ul>\n <li>3 Bed / 2 Bath</li>\n <li>Semi-detached home with side entrance</li>\n <li>Approx. 107 sq. m.</li>\n <li>West-facing rear garden</li>\n <li>Sunny rear orientation</li>\n <li>Steel shed to rear with electricity</li>\n <li>Separate concrete shed for additional storage</li>\n <li>Gas-fired central heating</li>\n <li>Low-maintenance front and rear gardens</li>\n <li>BER D</li>\n <li>Quiet cul-de-sac setting</li>\n <li>Feature bar in lounge</li>\n <li>Extended room with Velux windows</li>\n <li>Double electrical sockets to front and rear gardens</li>\n <li>Excellent location within a mature and highly sought-after development</li>\n <li>Blanchardstown Shopping Centre approximately 2km away</li>\n <li>Clonsilla & Coolmine train stations within easy reach</li>\n <li>Excellent access to N3 & M50 road networks</li>\n <li>Public transport routes at the entrance to the development</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers and those looking to trade up</li>\n <li>Viewing highly advised</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections: Eircode =  D15 V2TN"
      },
